{{!--
    An admonition, in the HTML Material for MkDocs styles directly.

    Material's `admonition` extension reads `!!! note`, and GitHub's
    `> [!NOTE]` means nothing to it - that renders as a plain blockquote with
    the marker left in the text. The `!!!` form is fragile here because it
    needs its body indented by four spaces, which a partial block spanning
    several lines will not do, so emit the markup the extension produces.
--}}

<div class="admonition {{kind}}" markdown="0"><p class="admonition-title">{{titlecase kind}}</p>
<p>{{~> @partial-block ~}}</p>
</div>
